# The Spektra XD fork presents its own READMEs; the upstream (and the
# ROpenData/SpektraLab development fork) present theirs. A sync that merges
# their main would otherwise take their README wholesale (it did once,
# 2026-11-17). These attributes keep this repository's versions on any
# non-fast-forward merge; the fast-forward loophole is closed by syncing
# with `git merge --no-ff` (see tools/sync-fork.ps1), and the
# readme-guard workflow fails a push whose READMEs lost the fork's name.
README.md merge=ours
README.zh-CN.md merge=ours
